        $ap${"nl":{"AI phone calling platform for outbound and conversational voice workflows.":"AI belt platform voor uitgaande en gespreksworkflows.","To get your API key:\n1. Log in to your [Bland AI dashboard](https://app.bland.ai)\n2. Go to **Profile** (bottom-left menu) -> **Settings**\n3. Click **API Keys** and copy your key":"Om uw API-sleutel te verkrijgen:\n1. Log in op uw [Bland AI dashboard](https://app.bland.ai)\n2. Ga naar **Profiel** (bottom-linkermenu) -> **Instellingen**\n3. Klik **API Key** en kopieer je sleutel","Send Call":"Oproep verzenden","Get Call Details":"Oproepgegevens ophalen","List Calls":"Lijst van oproepen","Custom API Call":"Custom API Call","Initiate an AI phone call to a recipient.":"Start een AI oproep aan een ontvanger.","Retrieve details for a specific Bland AI call.":"Gegevens ophalen voor een specifieke Bland AI oproep.","List recent Bland AI calls with optional filters.":"Lijst van recente Bland AI oproepen met optionele filters.","Make a custom API call to a specific endpoint":"Maak een aangepaste API call naar een specifiek eindpunt","Phone Number":"Telefoon nummer","Task":"Opdracht","Pathway ID":"Pathway ID","First Sentence":"Eerste zin","Voice":"Stem","Model":"Model","Language":"Taal","Max Duration (minutes)":"Max duur (minuten)","Wait for Greeting":"Wacht op begroeting","Record Call":"Gesprek opnemen","Transfer Phone Number":"Telefoonnummer overdragen","Webhook URL":"Webhook URL","Summary Prompt":"Samenvatting Prompt","Call ID":"Oproep ID","Limit":"Limiet","From Number":"Van nummer","To Number":"Naar Nummer","Method":"Methode","Headers":"Kopteksten","Query Parameters":"Query parameters","Body Type":"Type lichaam","Body":"Lichaam","Response is Binary ?":"Antwoord is binair?","No Error on Failure":"Geen fout bij fout","Timeout (in seconds)":"Time-out (in seconden)","Follow redirects":"Volg omleidingen","The number to call in E.164 format (e.g. +12223334444). Must include the country code.":"Het nummer voor aanroepen in E.164 formaat (bijv. 12223334444). Moet de landcode bevatten.","Instructions for the AI agent — what it should say, ask, or accomplish during the call. Not required if using a Pathway ID.":"Instructies voor de AI agent — wat moet het zeggen, vragen of voltooien tijdens het bellen. Niet verplicht als je een Pathway ID gebruikt.","UUID of a pre-built Pathway from your Bland AI dashboard. When provided, it overrides the Task field. Find it in the Pathways section of your dashboard.":"UUID van een vooraf opgebouwde Pathway van je Bland AI dashboard. Wanneer verstrekt, overschrijft het het takenveld. Zoek het in de Pathways sectie van uw dashboard.","Exact opening line the agent will say when the call is answered. Leave blank to let the agent decide.":"Exacte openingsregel die de agent zal zeggen wanneer de oproep wordt beantwoord. Laat leeg om de agent te laten beslissen.","The voice the AI agent will use. Choose from Bland AI preset voices optimised for phone quality.":"De stem die de AI agent zal gebruiken. Kies uit Bland AI preset stemmen geoptimaliseerd voor de telefoonkwaliteit.","\"Base\" is the standard model. \"Turbo\" is faster with lower latency, recommended for time-sensitive conversations.":"\"Base\" is het standaard model. \"Turbo\" is sneller met lagere latentie, aanbevolen voor tijdgevoelige gesprekken.","Language code for transcription and speech (e.g. \"en\", \"es\", \"fr\"). Defaults to \"babel-en\" (English with accent tolerance).":"Taalcode voor transcriptie en spraak (bijv. \"en\", \"fr\"). Standaard \"babel-\" (Engels met accent tolerantie).","Maximum call length in minutes. The call ends automatically after this time. Defaults to 30.":"Maximale gespreksduur in minuten. Het gesprek eindigt automatisch na deze tijd. Standaard op 30.","When enabled, the AI waits for the recipient to speak first before responding. Useful when calling into IVR systems.":"Wanneer ingeschakeld, wacht de AI op het woord van de ontvanger voordat ze reageren. Handig bij het bellen naar IVR-systemen.","When enabled, the call is recorded. The recording URL is included in the post-call data.":"Wanneer ingeschakeld, wordt de oproep opgenomen. De opname-URL is opgenomen in de post-gespreksgegevens.","E.164 phone number to transfer the call to if the AI decides a human is needed (e.g. +12223334444).":"Het nummer E.164 om de oproep over te dragen als de AI beslist dat een mens nodig is (bijv. +12223334444).","URL that receives a POST request with full call data (transcript, summary, recording URL) after the call ends.":"URL die een POST-aanvraag ontvangt met volledige oproepgegevens (transcript, samenvatting, opname van URL) na afloop van de oproep.","Custom instructions for how the post-call summary should be written (max 2000 characters). Leave blank to use the default summary format.":"Aangepaste instructies voor het schrijven van de samenvatting na oproep (max 2000 tekens). Laat leeg om het standaard samenvattingsformaat te gebruiken.","The Bland AI call identifier.":"De Bland AI bel identificator.","Maximum number of calls to return.":"Maximum aantal oproepen om terug te zenden.","Optional origin phone number filter.":"Filter van optionele oorsprong telefoonnummer.","Optional destination phone number filter.":"Filter telefoonnummer met optionele bestemming.","Authorization headers are injected automatically from your connection.":"Autorisatie headers worden automatisch geïnjecteerd vanuit uw verbinding.","Enable for files like PDFs, images, etc.":"Inschakelen voor bestanden zoals PDF's, afbeeldingen etc.","Maya — Young American Female":"Maya - Jonge Amerikaanse vrouw","Ryan — Professional American Male":"Ryan — Professionele Amerikaanse man","Mason — American Male":"Mason - Amerikaanse man","Tina — Gentle American Female":"Tina - Gentle American Vrouwelijk","Josh — American Male":"Josh - Amerikaanse man","Florian":"Floriaans","Derek":"Derek","June":"juni","Nat":"Nat","Paige":"Pakkel","Base (standard)":"Basis (standaard)","Turbo (lower latency)":"Turbo (onderlaat)","GET":"KRIJG","POST":"POSTE","PATCH":"BEKIJK","PUT":"PUT","DELETE":"VERWIJDEREN","HEAD":"HOOFD","None":"geen","JSON":"JSON","Form Data":"Formulieren gegevens","Raw":"Onbewerkte"},"de":{"AI phone calling platform for outbound and conversational voice workflows.":"KI-Anrufplattform für ausgehende und conversational Voice Workflows.","To get your API key:\n1. Log in to your [Bland AI dashboard](https://app.bland.ai)\n2. Go to **Profile** (bottom-left menu) -> **Settings**\n3. Click **API Keys** and copy your key":"Um Ihren API-Schlüssel zu erhalten:\n1. Loggen Sie sich in Ihr [Bland KI Dashboard](https://app.bland.ai)\n2. Gehe zu **Profil** (unten links) -> **Einstellungen**\n3. Klicke **API-Schlüssel** und kopiere deinen Schlüssel","Send Call":"Anruf senden","Get Call Details":"Anrufdetails abrufen","List Calls":"Anrufe auflisten","Custom API Call":"Eigener API-Aufruf","Initiate an AI phone call to a recipient.":"Initiieren Sie einen KI-Anruf an einen Empfänger.","Retrieve details for a specific Bland AI call.":"Rufen Sie Details für einen bestimmten Bland KI-Aufruf ab.","List recent Bland AI calls with optional filters.":"Liste der letzten Bland AI-Aufrufe mit optionalen Filtern.","Make a custom API call to a specific endpoint":"Einen benutzerdefinierten API-Aufruf an einen bestimmten Endpunkt machen","Phone Number":"Telefonnummer","Task":"Aufgabe","Pathway ID":"Pathway-ID","First Sentence":"Erster Satz","Voice":"Stimme","Model":"Modell","Language":"Sprache","Max Duration (minutes)":"Maximale Dauer (Minuten)","Wait for Greeting":"Warten auf Gruß","Record Call":"Anruf aufnehmen","Transfer Phone Number":"Überweisungsnummer","Webhook URL":"Webhook-URL","Summary Prompt":"Zusammenfassung-Aufforderung","Call ID":"Anruf-ID","Limit":"Limit","From Number":"Absendernummer","To Number":"An Nummer","Method":"Methode","Headers":"Kopfzeilen","Query Parameters":"Abfrageparameter","Body Type":"Körpertyp","Body":"Körper","Response is Binary ?":"Antwort ist binär?","No Error on Failure":"Kein Fehler bei Fehler","Timeout (in seconds)":"Timeout (in Sekunden)","Follow redirects":"Weiterleitungen folgen","The number to call in E.164 format (e.g. +12223334444). Must include the country code.":"Die Nummer für den Aufruf im E.164-Format (z.B. +122233344444444).","Instructions for the AI agent — what it should say, ask, or accomplish during the call. Not required if using a Pathway ID.":"Anweisungen für den KI-Agenten — was er während des Anrufs sagen sollte, fragen oder vollenden. Nicht erforderlich, wenn eine Pathway-ID verwendet wird.","UUID of a pre-built Pathway from your Bland AI dashboard. When provided, it overrides the Task field. Find it in the Pathways section of your dashboard.":"UUID eines vorgefertigten Pfades von deinem Bland AI Dashboard. Wenn vorhanden, überschreibt es das Aufgabenfeld. Finden Sie es im Abschnitt Pfadwege auf Ihrem Dashboard.","Exact opening line the agent will say when the call is answered. Leave blank to let the agent decide.":"Exakte Öffnungszeile, die der Agent angeben wird, wenn der Anruf beantwortet wird. Leer lassen, um den Agenten entscheiden zu lassen.","The voice the AI agent will use. Choose from Bland AI preset voices optimised for phone quality.":"Die Stimme, die der AI Agent verwenden wird. Wählen Sie aus Bland AI Preset Stimmen optimiert für die Telefonqualität.","\"Base\" is the standard model. \"Turbo\" is faster with lower latency, recommended for time-sensitive conversations.":"\"Base\" ist das Standardmodell. \"Turbo\" ist schneller mit niedrigerer Latenz, empfohlen für zeitsensible Gespräche.","Language code for transcription and speech (e.g. \"en\", \"es\", \"fr\"). Defaults to \"babel-en\" (English with accent tolerance).":"Sprachcode für Transkription und Sprache (z.B. \"en\", \"es\", \"fr\").","Maximum call length in minutes. The call ends automatically after this time. Defaults to 30.":"Maximale Anruflänge in Minuten. Der Anruf endet automatisch nach dieser Zeit. Standard ist 30.","When enabled, the AI waits for the recipient to speak first before responding. Useful when calling into IVR systems.":"Wenn aktiviert, wartet die KI darauf, dass der Empfänger zuerst spricht, bevor er reagiert. Nützlich beim Aufrufen in IVR-Systemen.","When enabled, the call is recorded. The recording URL is included in the post-call data.":"Wenn aktiviert, wird der Anruf aufgezeichnet. Die Aufzeichnungs-URL ist in den Post-Anruf-Daten enthalten.","E.164 phone number to transfer the call to if the AI decides a human is needed (e.g. +12223334444).":"E.164 Telefonnummer für die Übertragung des Anrufs an den Fall, dass die AI einen Menschen entscheidet (z.B. +1222333444444).","URL that receives a POST request with full call data (transcript, summary, recording URL) after the call ends.":"URL, die eine POST-Anfrage mit vollständigen Anrufdaten (Transkript, Zusammenfassung, Aufzeichnung der URL) nach dem Ende des Anrufs empfängt.","Custom instructions for how the post-call summary should be written (max 2000 characters). Leave blank to use the default summary format.":"Benutzerdefinierte Anleitung, wie die Zusammenfassung nach dem Aufruf geschrieben werden soll (max. 2000 Zeichen). Leer lassen, um das Standardformat der Zusammenfassung zu verwenden.","The Bland AI call identifier.":"Die Bland AI nennen Identifikator.","Maximum number of calls to return.":"Maximale Anzahl der zurückzugebenden Anrufe.","Optional origin phone number filter.":"Optionaler Rufnummer-Filter für die Ursprungsnummer.","Optional destination phone number filter.":"Optionaler Filter für Zielrufnummern.","Authorization headers are injected automatically from your connection.":"Autorisierungs-Header werden automatisch von Ihrer Verbindung injiziert.","Enable for files like PDFs, images, etc.":"Aktivieren für Dateien wie PDFs, Bilder usw.","Maya — Young American Female":"Maya — Junge amerikanische Frau","Ryan — Professional American Male":"Ryan — professioneller amerikanischer Mann","Mason — American Male":"Mason — Amerikanischer Mann","Tina — Gentle American Female":"Tina — Sanfte amerikanische Frau","Josh — American Male":"Josh — Amerikanischer Mann","Florian":"Jennifer","Derek":"Derek","June":"Juni","Nat":"Nat","Paige":"Pfarrer","Base (standard)":"Basis (Standard)","Turbo (lower latency)":"Turbo (niedrigere Latenz)","GET":"ERHALTEN","POST":"POST","PATCH":"PATCH","PUT":"PUT","DELETE":"LÖSCHEN","HEAD":"HEAD","None":"Keine","JSON":"JSON","Form Data":"Formulardaten","Raw":"Rohe"},"fr":{"AI phone calling platform for outbound and conversational voice workflows.":"Plateforme d'appel pour les flux vocaux sortants et conversationnels.","To get your API key:\n1. Log in to your [Bland AI dashboard](https://app.bland.ai)\n2. Go to **Profile** (bottom-left menu) -> **Settings**\n3. Click **API Keys** and copy your key":"Pour obtenir votre clé API :\n1. Connectez-vous à votre [tableau de bord IA Bland](https://app.bland.ai)\n2. Allez dans **Profil** (menu en bas à gauche) -> **Paramètres**\n3. Cliquez sur **Clés API** et copiez votre clé","Send Call":"Envoyer un appel","Get Call Details":"Obtenir les détails de l’appel","List Calls":"Lister les appels","Custom API Call":"Appel d'API personnalisé","Initiate an AI phone call to a recipient.":"Lancer un appel téléphonique IA à un destinataire.","Retrieve details for a specific Bland AI call.":"Récupérer les détails d'un appel spécifique à Bland AI.","List recent Bland AI calls with optional filters.":"Lister les appels récents à Bland AI avec des filtres facultatifs.","Make a custom API call to a specific endpoint":"Passer un appel API personnalisé à un endpoint spécifique","Phone Number":"Numéro de téléphone","Task":"Tâche","Pathway ID":"ID du chemin","First Sentence":"Première phrase","Voice":"Voix","Model":"Modélisation","Language":"Langue","Max Duration (minutes)":"Durée max (minutes)","Wait for Greeting":"Attendre les vœux","Record Call":"Enregistrer l'appel","Transfer Phone Number":"Transférer le numéro de téléphone","Webhook URL":"URL du Webhook","Summary Prompt":"Récapitulatif","Call ID":"ID de l'appel","Limit":"Limite","From Number":"À partir du numéro","To Number":"Vers le numéro","Method":"Méthode","Headers":"Headers","Query Parameters":"Paramètres de requête","Body Type":"Body Type","Body":"Body","Response is Binary ?":"La réponse est Binaire ?","No Error on Failure":"Aucune erreur en cas d'échec","Timeout (in seconds)":"Délai d'expiration (en secondes)","Follow redirects":"Suivre les redirections","The number to call in E.164 format (e.g. +12223334444). Must include the country code.":"Le numéro à appeler au format E.164 (par exemple +12223334444). Doit inclure l'indicatif du pays.","Instructions for the AI agent — what it should say, ask, or accomplish during the call. Not required if using a Pathway ID.":"Instructions pour l'agent IA — ce qu'il devrait dire, demander, ou accomplir pendant l'appel. Non requis si vous utilisez un identifiant de chemin.","UUID of a pre-built Pathway from your Bland AI dashboard. When provided, it overrides the Task field. Find it in the Pathways section of your dashboard.":"UUID d'un chemin pré-construit depuis votre tableau de bord de Bland IA. Lorsqu'il est fourni, il remplace le champ de tâches. Trouvez-le dans la section Chemins de votre tableau de bord.","Exact opening line the agent will say when the call is answered. Leave blank to let the agent decide.":"Ligne d'ouverture exacte que l'agent dira quand l'appel est répondu. Laissez vide pour laisser l'agent décider.","The voice the AI agent will use. Choose from Bland AI preset voices optimised for phone quality.":"La voix que l'agent IA utilisera. Choisissez parmi les voix prédéfinies de Bland AI optimisées pour la qualité du téléphone.","\"Base\" is the standard model. \"Turbo\" is faster with lower latency, recommended for time-sensitive conversations.":"\"Base\" est le modèle standard. \"Turbo\" est plus rapide avec une latence plus faible, recommandé pour les conversations sensibles au temps.","Language code for transcription and speech (e.g. \"en\", \"es\", \"fr\"). Defaults to \"babel-en\" (English with accent tolerance).":"Code de langue pour la transcription et la parole (par exemple \"fr\", \"en\", \"fr\"). Par défaut \"babel-fr\" (English with accent tolerance).","Maximum call length in minutes. The call ends automatically after this time. Defaults to 30.":"Longueur maximale de l'appel en minutes. L'appel se termine automatiquement après cette heure. Par défaut, 30.","When enabled, the AI waits for the recipient to speak first before responding. Useful when calling into IVR systems.":"Lorsqu'elle est activée, l'IA attend que le destinataire parle d'abord avant de répondre. Utile lors de l'appel aux systèmes IVR.","When enabled, the call is recorded. The recording URL is included in the post-call data.":"Lorsqu'il est activé, l'appel est enregistré. L'URL d'enregistrement est incluse dans les données post-appel.","E.164 phone number to transfer the call to if the AI decides a human is needed (e.g. +12223334444).":"Numéro de téléphone E.164 pour transférer l'appel si l'IA décide qu'un humain est nécessaire (par exemple +12223334444).","URL that receives a POST request with full call data (transcript, summary, recording URL) after the call ends.":"URL qui reçoit une requête POST avec les données d'appel complet (transcription, résumé, URL d'enregistrement) après la fin de l'appel.","Custom instructions for how the post-call summary should be written (max 2000 characters). Leave blank to use the default summary format.":"Instructions personnalisées pour écrire le résumé post-appel (max 2000 caractères). Laisser vide pour utiliser le format de résumé par défaut.","The Bland AI call identifier.":"L'identifiant d'appel de Bland AI.","Maximum number of calls to return.":"Nombre maximum d'appels à renvoyer.","Optional origin phone number filter.":"Filtre facultatif du numéro de téléphone d'origine.","Optional destination phone number filter.":"Filtre optionnel de numéro de téléphone de destination.","Authorization headers are injected automatically from your connection.":"Les Headers d'autorisation sont injectés automatiquement à partir de votre connexion.","Enable for files like PDFs, images, etc.":"Activer pour les fichiers comme les PDFs, les images, etc.","Maya — Young American Female":"Maya — Jeune femme américaine","Ryan — Professional American Male":"Ryan — Homme américain professionnel","Mason — American Male":"Mason — Homme américain","Tina — Gentle American Female":"Tina — Femme américaine douce","Josh — American Male":"Josh — Homme américain","Florian":"Florian","Derek":"Derek","June":"Juin","Nat":"Nat","Paige":"Apaiser","Base (standard)":"Base (standard)","Turbo (lower latency)":"Turbo (latence inférieure)","GET":"GET","POST":"POST","PATCH":"PATCH","PUT":"PUT","DELETE":"DELETE","HEAD":"HEAD","None":"Aucun","JSON":"JSON","Form Data":"Données du formulaire","Raw":"Brut"},"es":{"AI phone calling platform for outbound and conversational voice workflows.":"Plataforma de llamadas telefónicas de IA para flujos de trabajo de voz salientes y conversaciones.","To get your API key:\n1. Log in to your [Bland AI dashboard](https://app.bland.ai)\n2. Go to **Profile** (bottom-left menu) -> **Settings**\n3. Click **API Keys** and copy your key":"Para obtener su clave API:\n1. Inicie sesión en su [Panel de control de IA de Bland](https://app.bland.ai)\n2. Ve a **Perfil** (menú inferior izquierdo) -> **Configuración**\n3. Haz clic en **Claves API** y copia tu clave","Send Call":"Enviar llamada","Get Call Details":"Detalles de llamada","List Calls":"Listar llamadas","Custom API Call":"Llamada API personalizada","Initiate an AI phone call to a recipient.":"Inicie una llamada telefónica de IA a un destinatario.","Retrieve details for a specific Bland AI call.":"Recuperar detalles para una llamada específica de IA de Bland.","List recent Bland AI calls with optional filters.":"Listar las llamadas recientes de IA de Bland con filtros opcionales.","Make a custom API call to a specific endpoint":"Hacer una llamada API personalizada a un extremo específico","Phone Number":"Número de teléfono","Task":"Tarea","Pathway ID":"ID de ruta","First Sentence":"Primera frase","Voice":"Voz","Model":"Modelo","Language":"Idioma","Max Duration (minutes)":"Duración máxima (minutos)","Wait for Greeting":"Esperar Saludo","Record Call":"Grabar llamada","Transfer Phone Number":"Número de teléfono de transferencia","Webhook URL":"URL de Webhook","Summary Prompt":"Resumen","Call ID":"ID de llamada","Limit":"Límite","From Number":"Desde el número","To Number":"A número","Method":"Método","Headers":"Encabezados","Query Parameters":"Parámetros de consulta","Body Type":"Tipo de cuerpo","Body":"Cuerpo","Response is Binary ?":"¿Respuesta es binaria?","No Error on Failure":"No hay ningún error en fallo","Timeout (in seconds)":"Tiempo de espera (en segundos)","Follow redirects":"Seguir redirecciones","The number to call in E.164 format (e.g. +12223334444). Must include the country code.":"El número a llamar en formato E.164 (por ejemplo, +12223334444). Debe incluir el código de país.","Instructions for the AI agent — what it should say, ask, or accomplish during the call. Not required if using a Pathway ID.":"Instrucciones para el agente de IA — lo que debería decir, preguntar o completar durante la llamada. No es necesario si se utiliza un ID de ruta.","UUID of a pre-built Pathway from your Bland AI dashboard. When provided, it overrides the Task field. Find it in the Pathways section of your dashboard.":"UUID de un camino preconstruido desde tu panel de control de la IA de Bland. Cuando se proporciona, anula el campo de tareas. Encuéntralo en la sección de rutas de tu tablero.","Exact opening line the agent will say when the call is answered. Leave blank to let the agent decide.":"Línea de apertura exacta que el agente dirá cuando la llamada sea respondida. Deje en blanco para dejar que el agente decida.","The voice the AI agent will use. Choose from Bland AI preset voices optimised for phone quality.":"La voz que usará el agente de IA. Elija entre las voces predefinidas de Bland AI optimizadas para la calidad del teléfono.","\"Base\" is the standard model. \"Turbo\" is faster with lower latency, recommended for time-sensitive conversations.":"\"Base\" es el modelo estándar. \"Turbo\" es más rápido con menor latencia, recomendado para conversaciones sensibles al tiempo.","Language code for transcription and speech (e.g. \"en\", \"es\", \"fr\"). Defaults to \"babel-en\" (English with accent tolerance).":"Código de idioma para la transcripción y el habla (por ejemplo, \"en\", \"es\", \"fr\"). Por defecto es \"babel-en\" (Inglés con tolerancia de acción).","Maximum call length in minutes. The call ends automatically after this time. Defaults to 30.":"Longitud máxima de la llamada en minutos. La llamada termina automáticamente después de esta hora. Por defecto es 30.","When enabled, the AI waits for the recipient to speak first before responding. Useful when calling into IVR systems.":"Cuando está activado, la IA espera a que el receptor hable primero antes de responder. Útil cuando se llama a sistemas IVR.","When enabled, the call is recorded. The recording URL is included in the post-call data.":"Cuando se activa, la llamada se graba. La URL de grabación se incluye en los datos de postllamada.","E.164 phone number to transfer the call to if the AI decides a human is needed (e.g. +12223334444).":"E.164 número de teléfono al que transferir la llamada si la IA decide que un humano es necesario (por ejemplo, +12223334444).","URL that receives a POST request with full call data (transcript, summary, recording URL) after the call ends.":"URL que recibe una solicitud POST con los datos completos de las llamadas (transcripción, resumen, grabación de URL) una vez finalizada la llamada.","Custom instructions for how the post-call summary should be written (max 2000 characters). Leave blank to use the default summary format.":"Instrucciones personalizadas para cómo se debe escribir el resumen de la postllamada (máximo 2000 caracteres). Dejar en blanco para utilizar el formato de resumen predeterminado.","The Bland AI call identifier.":"El identificador de llamada de AI de Bland.","Maximum number of calls to return.":"Número máximo de llamadas a regresar.","Optional origin phone number filter.":"Filtro opcional de número de teléfono de origen.","Optional destination phone number filter.":"Filtro opcional de números de teléfono.","Authorization headers are injected automatically from your connection.":"Las cabeceras de autorización se inyectan automáticamente desde tu conexión.","Enable for files like PDFs, images, etc.":"Activar para archivos como PDFs, imágenes, etc.","Maya — Young American Female":"Maya — Joven Mujer Americana","Ryan — Professional American Male":"Ryan — Hombre americano profesional","Mason — American Male":"Masón — Hombre Americano","Tina — Gentle American Female":"Tina — Niñas Americanas","Josh — American Male":"Josh — Hombre Americano","Florian":"Floriano","Derek":"Derek","June":"Junio","Nat":"Nat","Paige":"Paige","Base (standard)":"Base (estándar)","Turbo (lower latency)":"Turbo (latencia inferior)","GET":"RECOGER","POST":"POST","PATCH":"PATCH","PUT":"PUT","DELETE":"BORRAR","HEAD":"LIMPIO","None":"Ninguna","JSON":"JSON","Form Data":"Datos de Formulario","Raw":"Rápido"},"ja":{"AI phone calling platform for outbound and conversational voice workflows.":"発信と会話の音声ワークフローのためのAI電話のプラットフォームを呼び出します。","To get your API key:\n1. Log in to your [Bland AI dashboard](https://app.bland.ai)\n2. Go to **Profile** (bottom-left menu) -> **Settings**\n3. Click **API Keys** and copy your key":"To get your API key:\n1. Log in to your [Bland AI dashboard](https://app.bland.ai)\n2. Go to **Profile** (bottom-left menu) -> **Settings**\n3. Click **API Keys** and copy your key","Send Call":"通話を送信","Get Call Details":"通話の詳細を取得","List Calls":"呼び出しリスト","Custom API Call":"カスタムAPI呼び出し","Initiate an AI phone call to a recipient.":"受信者にAI通話を開始します。","Retrieve details for a specific Bland AI call.":"Bland AI コールの詳細を取得します。","List recent Bland AI calls with optional filters.":"オプションのフィルタで最近の Bland AI コールをリストします。","Make a custom API call to a specific endpoint":"特定のエンドポイントへのカスタム API コールを実行します。","Phone Number":"電話番号","Task":"タスク","Pathway ID":"パスウェイID","First Sentence":"最初の文文","Voice":"音声","Model":"モデル","Language":"言語","Max Duration (minutes)":"最大期間 (分)","Wait for Greeting":"挨拶を待つ","Record Call":"通話の録音","Transfer Phone Number":"転送電話番号","Webhook URL":"Webhook URL","Summary Prompt":"概要のプロンプト表示","Call ID":"通話ID","Limit":"制限","From Number":"番号から","To Number":"To Number","Method":"方法","Headers":"ヘッダー","Query Parameters":"クエリパラメータ","Body Type":"ボディタイプ","Body":"本文","Response is Binary ?":"応答はバイナリですか?","No Error on Failure":"失敗時にエラーはありません","Timeout (in seconds)":"タイムアウト（秒）","Follow redirects":"リダイレクトをフォローする","The number to call in E.164 format (e.g. +12223334444). Must include the country code.":"E.164形式（例：+1222333444）で通話する番号。国コードを含める必要があります。","Instructions for the AI agent — what it should say, ask, or accomplish during the call. Not required if using a Pathway ID.":"AIエージェントの手順 — 呼び出し中に何を尋ねるか、または達成する必要があります。パスウェイIDを使用する場合は必要ありません。","UUID of a pre-built Pathway from your Bland AI dashboard. When provided, it overrides the Task field. Find it in the Pathways section of your dashboard.":"Bland AIダッシュボードから構築済みのPathwayのUUID。 提供されると、タスクフィールドが上書きされます。ダッシュボードのformat@@0セクションでそれを見つけます。","Exact opening line the agent will say when the call is answered. Leave blank to let the agent decide.":"エージェントが通話に応答したとき、エージェントが正確に開く行を開きます。エージェントに指定させるには空白のままにします。","The voice the AI agent will use. Choose from Bland AI preset voices optimised for phone quality.":"AIエージェントが使用する音声。電話品質に合わせて最適化されたBland AIプリセットの音声から選択します。","\"Base\" is the standard model. \"Turbo\" is faster with lower latency, recommended for time-sensitive conversations.":"